# SERIAL alone, a win: the gun shoots the killers only and the game lasts
# the two minutes with lives left (README.md, docs/serial/DESIGN.md).
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame serial --headless --ms 125000 --input tools/play/serial-alone-win.input
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame serial --headless --ms 125000 --fix all,-serial_intro_screen,-serial_end_screen --input tools/play/serial-alone-win.input
#
# Generated by `tools/serial_plan.py --start 0 --win` (SERIAL's WM_CREATE at
# 0 ms seeds the figures; the hits change the spawns too). Every shot is a
# SPACE press with the bullet free. The two versions play different games
# (BUGS.md K5: the Corrigida's lane 2 spawns on its own timer too), so each
# shot hits a killer in at least one of them and nothing else:
# - Original: two killers, +400, 2 lives left when the clock ends the game
#   at 120000 ms; the result packs MAKELONG(lives 2, 500) = 32768002
#   (K1/K2);
# - `--fix all`: one killer, +200, 3 lives left: a win of 500.
1000 dump start
# shot 1: straight, 3sbabt (figure 2, kind 2)
16200 key right
16320 key space
16700 dump shot
# shot 2: straight, Original 3snoem (figure 9, kind 2), Corrigida a miss
106420 key space
121000 result won 32768002 | won 500
